WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.010
Set the large dot.

2
00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.395
Stand the camera on something steady.

3
00:00:04.395 --> 00:00:09.085
Hold the rocker level to open it, count, then press it down, and wind on.

4
00:00:09.085 --> 00:00:13.417
With ISO 400 film: in sun, open and shut.

5
00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:15.062
Cloud, count 1.

6
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:16.802
Shade, count 3.

7
00:00:16.802 --> 00:00:19.517
Indoors by a window, count 40.

8
00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:24.172
The pinhole lets in about 150 times less light than the large dot,

9
00:00:24.172 --> 00:00:27.145
so a pinhole picture is counted, not snapped.

